  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FARCHA POWER PLANT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT IS TO ALLEVIATE ON URGENT BASIS, THE ACUTE ELECTRICITY SHORTAGE IN THE CAPITAL CITY, THROUGH ACQUISITION  INSTALLATION OF NEW DIESEL ENGINE GENERATORS, ALLOWING TO BRING AN ADDITIONAL PRODUCTION CAPAVITY OF ABOUT 33MEGAWATTS (MW) TO THE EXISTING 8_9 MW CURRENTLY PRODUCED BY THE N&apos;DJAMENA POWER PLANT.</narrative>
  </description>
